      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Classy filly ARK SEA (3) makes her first appearance since a brave third in July's Queensland Oaks where she worked hard to find the front and stuck on well. Holds unbeaten records at the circuit, the distance and when fresh. Ready to go off a couple of trials and has the speed to take advantage of the good draw. YIRRADIVA (10) worked from this barrier when a brave second off a let-up two back at Wagga then led from a wide draw to win last start. Tricky barrier but she is capable and owns a good record at this distance. SWIFT CODE (7) has been chasing some smart rivals since a Redcliffe win three back and did manage a G3 placing in the Redcliffe Oaks over the winter. WHERES MY REASON (9) has put together a series top-two results including a win from this barrier at Newcastle.",
